### Phase 3: Image Compression Pipeline (Future-proofing)

Even though there are no images yet, this prevents the problem when images ARE added.

#### [MODIFY] [file_service.dart](file:///c:/Users/Moazzam%20Samoo/Desktop/Tahir%20Showroom/lib/app/core/services/file_service.dart)

Add a private `_compressImage()` method and call it in all 7 save methods:

```dart
import 'package:image/image.dart' as img;

/// Compress and resize image before storing
Future<File> _compressImage(File sourceFile, {
  int maxWidth = 1200,  // Good quality for CNIC scans
  int quality = 75,     // 75% JPEG quality is visually excellent
}) async {
  try {
    final bytes = await sourceFile.readAsBytes();
    final decoded = img.decodeImage(bytes);
    if (decoded == null) return sourceFile;

    img.Image resized = decoded;
    if (decoded.width > maxWidth) {
      resized = img.copyResize(decoded, width: maxWidth);
    }

    final compressed = img.encodeJpg(resized, quality: quality);
    final tempPath = '${sourceFile.path}_compressed.jpg';
    final tempFile = File(tempPath);
    await tempFile.writeAsBytes(compressed);
    return tempFile;
  } catch (e) {
    debugPrint('Image compression failed, using original: $e');
    return sourceFile; // Fallback: use the original
  }
}
```

